          "_name": "features030",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features030\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#9fe870\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 content-head mb-5\">\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style  mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Health Facts</b></h1>\n                <p class=\"mbr-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-subtitle\">\n                    Great for pro-coders for fast prototyping and small customers' projects.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center  blockContent\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper align-left\">\n                    <div class=\"mbr-text counter-container mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                        <div><b>Did you know?</b></div><ol>\n                            \n                            <li><b>Your bones</b> <b>are stronger than concrete</b>: gram for gram, bone can withstand more pressure than concrete.</li>\n                            <li><b>The liver is the only major internal organ that can regenerate. </b>It can regrow much of its lost<b> </b>tissue if part of it is<b> </b>removed.</li><li><b>Your heart beats about 100,000 times everyday</b>, pumping around <b>7,500 litres </b>of blood throughout your body.</li><li><b>Every second,</b> <b>your body produces about 2.4 million red blood cells </b>to replace old ones.</li><li><b>Your brain can generate enough electricity to power a small LED bulb</b>. This comes from the electrical signals sent between billions of nerve cells.</li><li><b>The cornea of the eye receives oxygen directly from the air,</b> making it the only tissue in the human body without blood vessels.</li><li><b>Your DNA is astonishingly long</b>. If the DNA from all the cells in one human body were stretched end to end, it would reach billions of kilometres, far beyond the distance from the Earth to the Sun.</li><li><b>Babies are born with about 270 bones, </b>but adults have only <b>206 </b>because some bones fuse together as they.</li><li><b>Your brain uses 20% of your body's oxygen</b>, despite making up only about <b>2% </b>of your body weight.&nbsp;</li><li><b>You shed around 30,000 to 40,000 dead skin cells every minute</b>, meaning much of the dust in your home contains tiny amount of human skin</li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper mb-4\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/000000-612x1200.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vqA6Td2Klz",
          "_anchor": "features030-1b",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
